Markdown configuration
==============================================================

**docsify** uses [marked](https://github.com/markedjs/marked) as its Markdown parser. You can customize how it renders your Markdown content to HTML by customizing `renderer`:

```
window.$docsify = {
  markdown: {
    smartypants: true,
    renderer: {
      link() {
        // ...
      },
    },
  },
};
```

